<section class="section" style="padding-top:56px"><div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px">
  <h1 style="font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,40px)">Data protection</h1>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-top:10px">How SeaGeek keeps your company's data private, and what you control. Written in plain language; the full privacy notice and terms apply.</p>
  <h2 style="margin-top:32px">Your data is yours</h2>
  <ul class="plain"><li>We never use your conversations, documents or customer details to train AI models.</li><li>We never sell your data or share it with other companies.</li><li>Each company's data is kept separate. Staff at one company cannot see another company's data.</li></ul>
  <h2 style="margin-top:28px">What is removed before AI sees it</h2>
  <p>Before any message or document reaches an AI model, card numbers, South African ID numbers, bank account numbers, passwords and secret keys are removed and replaced with a note. Names, emails and phone numbers are kept so the assistant can reply to people.</p>
  <h2 style="margin-top:28px">You decide</h2>
  <ul class="plain"><li><b>Switch AI off</b> for your company's data at any time. Chats go straight to your team, and assistants stop.</li><li><b>Choose how long we keep conversations</b>: 30 days to 2 years, or never delete. Open work is never deleted.</li><li><b>Download everything</b> we hold for your company in one file, at any time.</li><li><b>Control who sees what</b>: each team member gets only the areas you choose, and every change is recorded in an activity log.</li></ul>
  <h2 style="margin-top:28px">Who helps us run SeaGeek</h2>
  <p>To deliver messages, payments and AI answers we use trusted providers, including AI model providers, email and SMS networks, WhatsApp, PayFast for payments, and our hosting provider. Each receives only what it needs to do its job.</p>
  <h2 style="margin-top:28px">Your rights under POPIA</h2>
  <p>South Africa's Protection of Personal Information Act gives you the right to know what we hold about you, to correct it, and to ask us to delete it. Write to <a class="link" href="mailto:hello@seageek.co.za">hello@seageek.co.za</a> and we respond within the time the law allows.</p>
  <p class="muted small" style="margin-top:28px">This page describes how the platform works today. It should be reviewed by a qualified lawyer before it is relied on as a legal commitment.</p>
</div></section>
